  m_text: 'Adventurer, beware!


    Many have come here seeking glory, yet all they
    reaped was death.


    An ancient and evil presence stalks these halls, leaving
    the planes of existence shattered in its wake.


    Those who cannot bridge
    the planes will be cursed to wander the halls for all eternity.


    You have
    been warned.


    Enter if you dare!'
